   "fieldtype": "HTML",
   "options": "<p class=\"text-muted small\">Add this to your Print Format's HTML, sized to match the Width/Height on the right (in points; roughly px at 96dpi) so the layout reserves room for the stamp instead of it overlapping existing content:</p><pre style=\"font-size:12px;\">&lt;div style=\"display:inline-block; width:150px; height:50px;\"&gt;\n  &lt;span style=\"color:#ffffff;\"&gt;##DIGITAL_SIGN_ANCHOR##&lt;/span&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;</pre><p class=\"text-muted small\">Use color:#ffffff (matching the background), not opacity:0 - some PDF engines skip painting opacity:0 text entirely, dropping it from the searchable text layer too. If the surrounding background isn't white, match this color to it instead.</p>"
